#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column ruled form inspired by the Japanese rirekisho: a bordered header of field cells and every section as a table with a solid title bar; dense and fast to scan for engineering, operations, or applications in Japan."
msgstr "Yapon rirekisho rezyumesidan ilhomlangan bitta ustunli shakl: chegaralangan maydonlardan iborat sarlavha va har bir bo'lim qattiq sarlavha satriga ega jadval sifatida taqdim etilgan. Yaponiyadagi muhandislik ishlari, operatsion ishlar yoki ish arizalari uchun ixcham va skanerlash oson."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column set like a magazine feature: a large display name under an uppercase kicker and the summary as a larger standfirst; refined for writers, designers, and communications roles."
msgstr "Jurnal maqolasi kabi tuzilgan bir ustunli maket: bosh harflardagi kichik sarlavha ostida yirik ism va xulosa kattaroq kirish xatboshisi sifatida; yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar va kommunikatsiya mutaxassislari uchun nafis tanlov."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column Wall Street style with a centered header and ruled section headings."
msgstr "Markazga tekislangan sarlavha va chiziqlar bilan ajratilgan boʻlim sarlavhalariga ega bir ustunli Wall Street uslubi."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column with a magenta left border accent; compact and efficient for entry-level or internship applications."
msgstr "Magenta rangli chap chegarasi aksenti bilan bir ustunli; ixcham va samarali, boshlang'ich daraja yoki amaliyot uchun arizalarga mos."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column with a minimal top header and lots of whitespace; clean and modern for designers or content creators."
msgstr "Minimal yuqori sarlavha va ko'plab bo'sh joyli bir ustunli; dizaynerlar yoki kontent yaratish uchun toza va zamonaviy."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column with uppercase section headings and a primary-color top rule on every page; polished for executive, consulting, or startup resumes."
msgstr "Har bir sahifada bosh harflar bilan yozilgan bo'lim sarlavhalari va asosiy rangdagi yuqori qoidasi bo'lgan bitta ustunli; rahbariyat, konsalting yoki startap rezyumelari uchun sayqallangan."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column with uppercase section headings over a rule and the photo beside the name; compact and ATS-friendly, well-suited for Asian resume conventions (CN/JP/KR)."
msgstr "Bitta ustun, bo‘lim sarlavhalari katta harflarda chiziq ustida va surat ism yonida; ixcham, ATS tizimlariga mos va Osiyo rezyume me’yorlariga (CN/JP/KR) qulay."

#: src/dialogs/resume/template/data.ts
msgid "Single-column; polished and serious for senior or enterprise-level positions."
msgstr "Bir ustunli; sayqallangan va jiddiy, yuqori darajali yoki korporativ lavozimlar uchun."

